{"speciesId":609,"names":{"fr":"Lugulabre","es":"Chandelure","en":"Chandelure","ja":"シャンデラ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il brûle en aspirant les âmes, et hypnotise ses ennemis en faisant osciller les flammes de ses bras."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"It absorbs a spirit, which it then burns. By waving the flames on its arms, it puts its foes into a hypnotic trance."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Les victimes des flammes de Lugulabre voient leur âme aspirée jusqu’à ce que leur corps ne soit plus que coquille vide."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Being consumed in Chandelure’s flame burns up the spirit, leaving the body behind."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The spirits burned up in its ominous flame lose their way and wander this world forever."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The spirits burned up in its ominous flame lose their way and wander this world forever."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Les victimes des flammes de Lugulabre voient leur âme aspirée jusqu’à ce que leur corps ne soit plus que coquille vide."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Sus llamas absorben el alma del enemigo y la abrasan, dejando solo su cuerpo inerte."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Being consumed in Chandelure’s flame burns up the spirit, leaving the body behind."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"シャンデラの 炎に 包まれると 魂が 吸い取られ 燃やされる。 抜け殻の 体 だけが 残る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Les âmes consumées par ses flammes étranges sont condamnées à l’errance pour l’éternité."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Las almas que han ardido bajo sus oscuras llamas vagan sin rumbo y eternamente por este mundo."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"The spirits burned up in its ominous flame lose their way and wander this world forever."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"怪しげな 炎で 燃やされた 魂は 行き場を なくし この 世を 永遠に さまよう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Les victimes des flammes de Lugulabre voient leur âme aspirée jusqu’à ce que leur corps ne soit plus que coquille vide."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Sus llamas absorben el alma del enemigo y la abrasan, dejando solo su cuerpo inerte."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Being consumed in Chandelure’s flame burns up the spirit, leaving the body behind."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"シャンデラの 炎に 包まれると 魂が 吸い取られ 燃やされる。 抜け殻の 体 だけが 残る。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Les âmes consumées par ses flammes étranges sont condamnées à l’errance pour l’éternité."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Las almas que han ardido bajo sus oscuras llamas vagan sin rumbo y eternamente por este mundo."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"The spirits burned up in its ominous flame lose their way and wander this world forever."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"怪しげな 炎で 燃やされた 魂は 行き場を なくし この 世を 永遠に さまよう。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il s’installe dans les résidences anciennes. Pour hypnotiser son adversaire, il agite les flammes de ses bras de manière inquiétante."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Establece su morada en edificios antiguos. Mece las llamas de los brazos de forma siniestra para hipnotizar a sus enemigos."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"This Pokémon haunts dilapidated mansions. It sways its arms to hypnotize opponents with the ominous dancing of its flames."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"古びた 洋館に 棲みつく。 腕の 炎を 妖しく 揺らし 相手を 催眠に かけるぞ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"On raconte que dans les manoirs éclairés par des Lugulabre, les funérailles s’enchaînent sans discontinuer."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Cuentan que, en las mansiones donde se usaba para la iluminación, los funerales se sucedían de forma incesante."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"In homes illumi